(7624401, 1235275, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> How in the world do you find this stuff, Anita?!<br/> <br/>It''s fabulous!<br/> <br/>How long were you there before you snapped this?! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think I was there for half an hour. I actually had a few beauties I could of entered. I wait patiently for life to happen in front of me, it helps to have a good location. This tiny embankment overlooks the beach. People love to stand or sit there waiting for the sun to set, so its perfect for silhouettes.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment BTW, I love photography because every photo becomes a  story, some more than others.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: How in the world do you find this stuff, Anita?! It''s fabulous! How long were you there before you snapped this?!   I think I was there for half an hour. I actually had a few beauties I could of entered. I wait patiently for life to happen in front of me, it helps to have a good location. This tiny embankment overlooks the beach. People love to stand or sit there waiting for the sun to set, so its perfect for silhouettes. Thanks for your comment BTW, I love photography because every photo becomes a  story, some more than others.', '2019-04-13 08:04:16.000000', NULL, 0),
